    }
</textarea></div><hr/><h3 class="h3">22) How can you sort the elements of an array in descending order?</h3><p>C program to sort the element of an array in descending order.</p><div class="codeblock"><textarea class="cpp" name="code"> #include&lt;stdio.h&gt;
